        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Scorpio &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>Fifteen needles delivered in a single burst rather than one at a time.</em></p><p>Make <strong>four unarmed Strikes</strong> against any creatures within 30 feet at <strong>no increase to your multiple attack penalty</strong>. Each Strike that hits applies <strong>one needle</strong> in addition to its normal effect.</p><p>On any day your constellation is ascendant, Strikes that <em>miss</em> apply a needle too.</p><p>The activity counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty afterward.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 15th and 19th level, add one Strike.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
